@ Uplift
: Startide Rising glossary
The process by which an already-sapient patron species helps another species develop full intelligence and Galactic status.

@ uplift
: Startide Rising glossary
The process by which an already-sapient patron species helps another species develop full intelligence and Galactic status.

@ Patron
& patron
: Startide Rising glossary
A species responsible for uplifting another species. Galactic society places major weight on patron-client lineage.

@ Client
& client
: Startide Rising glossary
A species that has been uplifted by a patron species and is bound into a long patron-client relationship.

@ Earthclan
& Earth Clan
: Startide Rising glossary
Humanity and the species humanity has uplifted. Earthclan is unusual in Galactic society because humans have no known patron.

@ neo-dolphin
& neo-dolphins
& neodolphin
& neodolphins
: Startide Rising glossary
An uplifted dolphin. Dolphins form most of the crew of the exploration ship *Streaker*.

@ neo-chimp
& neo-chimps
& neochimp
& neochimps
: Startide Rising glossary
An uplifted chimpanzee; one of humanity's client species.

@ Streaker
& Streaker
: Startide Rising glossary
The Earthclan exploration vessel at the center of the story, crewed mainly by neo-dolphins.

@ Kithrup
& Kithrup
: Startide Rising glossary
The planet where much of *Startide Rising* takes place.

@ Creideiki
& Creideiki
: Startide Rising glossary
The neo-dolphin captain of *Streaker*.

@ Gillian Baskin
& Gillian
& Baskin
: Startide Rising glossary
A human scientist and officer aboard *Streaker*.

@ Toshio Iwashika
& Toshio
& Iwashika
: Startide Rising glossary
A young human midshipman aboard *Streaker*.

@ Tom Orley
& Tom
& Orley
: Startide Rising glossary
A human member of *Streaker*'s crew.

@ Tymbrimi
& Tymbrimi
: Startide Rising glossary
A Galactic species generally more sympathetic toward Earthclan than many other Galactic powers.

@ Tandu
& Tandu
: Startide Rising glossary
One of the Galactic powers involved in the struggle surrounding *Streaker*. Distinct from the other pursuing factions.

@ Soro
& Soro
: Startide Rising glossary
A Galactic species with its own patron-client relationships and interests in the events surrounding *Streaker*.

@ Gubru
& Gubru
: Startide Rising glossary
A Galactic species involved in the wider competition surrounding Earthclan and *Streaker*.

@ Galactic Library
& Library
& Galactic Libraries
: Startide Rising glossary
The immense inherited body of Galactic knowledge. Established civilizations rely heavily on it rather than rediscovering or reinventing knowledge from scratch.

@ Galactics
& Galactic
: Startide Rising glossary
Loose shorthand for the many older alien civilizations participating in established Galactic society. They are not a single unified faction.
